{
  "name": "Blessing of the Ravaged Body",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have a pool of power fueled by your zealous fervor that replenishes when you finish a Long Rest. The pool has a number of points equal to five times your Cleric level. You cannot benefit from this feature while you are wearing armor.</p><p>As a Bonus Action, you draw power from the pool to give yourself Temporary Hit Points, up to the maximum amount remaining in the pool.</p><p>You can also expend 5 points from the pool to remove the Charmed, Frightened or Poisoned conditions from yourself, those points do not also give Temporary Hit Points.</p>",
